{
  "$comment": "Authoritative decision-case table for scripts/port-tick/contention.mjs. Per plugins/port/docs/PIPELINE.md → 'File contention': held only at or above concurrency.overlapThreshold against one in-flight item's non-shared claims, counted per in-flight item, never pooled; fewest-conflicts-first ordering among survivors.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "function": "parseFilesBlock",
      "name": "no files fence at all — unstructured plan",
      "input": "## Changes\nNo fence here.",
      "expected": null
